  "title": "HEIDMAR MARITIME HOLDINGS CORP. EXPANDS SHIP MANAGEMENT PLATFORM",
  "summary": "Athens / New York, 07 July 2026 – Heidmar Maritime Holdings Corp. (the “Company” or“Heidmar”) (NASDAQ: HMR) today announces that it has completed the acquisition of Q-Shipping B.V., a ship management and crewing business, adding nine vessels to its managed fleet and establishing an operating presence in the Netherlands and Türkiye,with a dedicated crewing capability […]",
